    "type": "TEXT",
    "content": {
      "v": 1,
      "tag": "Welcome",
      "title": "We",
      "text": "If you’re reading this, it means that very soon you’ll see one of us in a wedding dress — and we think you can guess which one…"
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "TEXT",
    "content": {
      "v": 1,
      "tag": "Story",
      "title": "A story",
      "text": "It all started in college. We were just acquaintances who passed each other every day but never really talked.\nThen one night, at a campus party, we happened to end up in the same group. We started talking and instantly felt at ease, as if we understood each other. It was easy and fun, like we’d known each other our whole lives.\nFrom then on, we spent more and more time together. We wandered around the city, watched movies, went to concerts and talked until late at night. Soon we realized we’d become an essential part of each other’s lives. We were always there for each other, cheering each other on and sharing our dreams and plans for the future."
    }
  },
